OL,3,GNEWSACommonwealth gold medal for
OL,4,Astudent powerlifter
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university student has been crowned
OL,7,F2026 Commonwealth Powerlifting
OL,8,FChampion.
OL,10,FCaitlin Baxter who attends the
OL,11,FUniversity of Sunderland, represented
OL,12,FEngland in the Open 57kg category,
OL,13,Ffinishing first overall.
OL,15,FPowerlifting is a strength-based sport
OL,16,Fthat focuses on three main lifts, the
OL,17,Fsquat, the bench press, and the
OL,18,Fdeadlift.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
