OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACommonwealth gold medal for
OL,4,Astudent powerlifter
OL,5,
OL,6,FBaxter, who is studying for a
OL,7,FPostgraduate Diploma in Clinical
OL,8,FPharmacy at the University, took gold
OL,9,Fin both the squat and bench press
OL,10,Fbefore securing third place in the
OL,11,Fdeadlift. She said "a huge amount of
OL,12,Fhard work" had gone into reaching the
OL,13,Fcompetition, which took place in
OL,14,FWinnipeg, Canada in September.
